From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rtl8188fu: feed EXTRA_CFLAGS into kbuild

EXTRA_CFLAGS is no longer consumed by the kernel build system.
Pass it through subdir-ccflags-y so the driver's include paths
and defines reach the subdirectory objects again.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/Makefile	2026-11-02 08:17:42.882850237 -0500
+++ b/Makefile	2026-11-02 08:17:42.884380109 -0500
@@ -2503,3 +2503,5 @@
 	rm -fr .tmp_versions
 endif
 
+
+subdir-ccflags-y += $(EXTRA_CFLAGS)
